	"The Ghost Ship That Didn't Carry Us | Dear Sugar",
	"https://therumpus.net/2011/04/21/dear-sugar-the-rumpus-advice-column-71-the-ghost-ship-that-didnt-carry-us/",
	"If the muse comes to your bedside, don't tell her you'll fuck her later.",
